WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.660 --> 00:00:07.720
Hello, everybody, my name is Markiplier and welcome to my public Discord server.

00:00:07.880 --> 00:00:10.740
Now whether or not it was a good idea to make a public discord server

00:00:10.740 --> 00:00:12.280
is not what I'm here to talk about.

00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:14.060
In fact, when I first decided to do this

00:00:14.070 --> 00:00:17.840
I was only curious if I could actually break discord altogether.

00:00:17.840 --> 00:00:19.900
Short answer is yes, I could,

00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:21.840
and long answer is yes, I did.

00:00:22.240 --> 00:00:25.100
But what came out of it actually surprised me.

00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:29.160
I divided the server up into various rooms that you'd find in my house

00:00:29.160 --> 00:00:30.700
in Markiplier Manor

00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:32.780
which is the name of the discord server.

00:00:32.900 --> 00:00:33.820
Now you've got the attic,

00:00:33.860 --> 00:00:34.540
the study,

00:00:34.540 --> 00:00:36.080
your brother's room, your sister's room,

00:00:36.080 --> 00:00:38.940
the bathroom, the basement, the backyard, the jacuzzi

00:00:38.940 --> 00:00:41.660
You've got a whole bunch of different rooms and each of these rooms have been

00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:46.580
subdivided into a wonderful culture of people that are weird and wonderful

00:00:47.060 --> 00:00:48.480
and awful and great

00:00:48.480 --> 00:00:50.520
But I'm not here to talk about the community, no.

00:00:50.520 --> 00:00:54.449
I realized that there was one thing very lacking in this entire server

00:00:54.449 --> 00:00:57.500
And that's a place to relieve some tension

00:00:57.500 --> 00:00:59.600
-- and no, oddly enough that's not in the bathroom

00:00:59.600 --> 00:01:03.960
I'm talking about a place where you can vent your frustrations to the open air

00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:07.460
and everyone and anyone can participate at any time

00:01:07.460 --> 00:01:10.000
and very most likely all at once

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:12.380
This... is my screaming room

00:01:12.440 --> 00:01:15.340
*horrible noise*

00:01:15.360 --> 00:01:19.520
So here's the thing: in discord you can make a public voice Channel

00:01:19.530 --> 00:01:21.800
I've got various ones here that people can talk to,

00:01:21.800 --> 00:01:23.939
they've got limits on the number of users that can be in

00:01:23.940 --> 00:01:26.400
I've got a team of moderators that are helping keeping it all sane,

00:01:26.960 --> 00:01:33.020
But, what I wanted is to make a room that was entirely dedicated just to venting frustration

00:01:33.240 --> 00:01:34.600
in whatever manner you saw fit

00:01:34.880 --> 00:01:37.020
and so that is all the introduction that I'm gonna do

00:01:37.020 --> 00:01:39.420
because right now I need to find out if it's gonna work

00:01:39.420 --> 00:01:42.000
because honestly, I don't even know.

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:44.840
You'd think that I would tell my moderators about this beforehand

00:01:44.860 --> 00:01:47.800
But I'm not gonna do that and it's not because I'm a douche...

00:01:49.580 --> 00:01:50.080
Eh?!

00:01:52.860 --> 00:01:53.360
That is..

00:01:54.300 --> 00:01:54.800
surprising

00:01:54.800 --> 00:01:56.580
Welcome to the screaming room.

00:01:56.580 --> 00:01:59.660
